        "original_id": "b9e2cca0-2ed9-5063-9649-9864c50a6272",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Elton John\n- Events: Follow the Yellow Brick Road Tour\n- Works: Goodbye Yellow Brick Road\n- Places: North America, Europe, Château d'Hérouville, France, Jamaica\n\nFacts:\n- In 1973, Elton John released the album Goodbye Yellow Brick Road.\n- Goodbye Yellow Brick Road was recorded at the Château d'Hérouville in France after recording problems at the intended location in Jamaica.\n- Follow the Yellow Brick Road Tour is a concert tour by Elton John in North America and Europe.\n- Follow the Yellow Brick Road Tour promotes the 40th-anniversary re-release of Goodbye Yellow Brick Road.",
